{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36603","headline":"自湘川东下立春泊夏口阻风登孙权城 · 罗隐","name":"自湘川东下立春泊夏口阻风登孙权城","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吴门此去逾千里，湘浦离来想数旬。\n只见风师长占路，不知青帝已行春。\n危怜坏堞犹遮水，狂爱寒梅欲傍人。\n事往时移何足问，且凭村酒暖精神。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36603.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36603","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}